# =============================================================================
# WOOWTECH / Woow_podman_litellm  -  environment file for the QUADLET path
# WOOWTECH / Woow_podman_litellm  -  Quadlet 部署路徑專用的環境變數檔
# =============================================================================
#
# WHERE THIS FILE MUST BE INSTALLED / 本檔案必須安裝的位置
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# English:
#   Rootless (recommended). Copy it OUTSIDE the git working tree so a stray
#   `git add -f` can never leak it, and lock the permissions down:
#
#       mkdir -p ~/.config/litellm
#       cp .env.quadlet.example ~/.config/litellm/litellm.env
#       chmod 700 ~/.config/litellm
#       chmod 600 ~/.config/litellm/litellm.env
#       # then edit ~/.config/litellm/litellm.env and replace every placeholder
#
#   The .container units reference it as:
#       EnvironmentFile=%h/.config/litellm/litellm.env
#   (%h expands to the service user's home directory.)
#
#   Rootful (units in /etc/containers/systemd/) - install it as root instead:
#       sudo install -d -m 700 /etc/litellm
#       sudo install -m 600 .env.quadlet.example /etc/litellm/litellm.env
#   and change the units to EnvironmentFile=/etc/litellm/litellm.env
#
#   chmod 600 is not optional. Everything in this file is a credential.
#
# 中文：
#   Rootless（建議做法）。請把它複製到 git 工作目錄「之外」，避免誤用
#   `git add -f` 而外洩，並限制權限：
#
#       mkdir -p ~/.config/litellm
#       cp .env.quadlet.example ~/.config/litellm/litellm.env
#       chmod 700 ~/.config/litellm
#       chmod 600 ~/.config/litellm/litellm.env
#       # 接著編輯 ~/.config/litellm/litellm.env，把所有佔位字串換成真實值
#
#   .container unit 以下列方式引用它：
#       EnvironmentFile=%h/.config/litellm/litellm.env
#   （%h 會展開為該服務使用者的家目錄。）
#
#   Rootful（unit 放在 /etc/containers/systemd/）請改以 root 安裝：
#       sudo install -d -m 700 /etc/litellm
#       sudo install -m 600 .env.quadlet.example /etc/litellm/litellm.env
#   並把 unit 改成 EnvironmentFile=/etc/litellm/litellm.env
#
#   chmod 600 不是選配。這個檔案裡的每一行都是憑證。
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FORMAT RULES - THIS FILE IS NOT A SHELL SCRIPT
# 格式規則 - 這個檔案不是 shell script
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# English:
#   * Plain KEY=VALUE, one per line. Nothing else.
#   * NO shell interpolation. `${VAR}`, `${VAR:-default}` and `${VAR:?message}`
#     do NOT work here - those are docker-compose.yml features only. Every value
#     must be written out in full, literally.
#   * NO command substitution. `$(openssl rand -hex 32)` is NOT executed; it
#     would be stored as that literal text. Run the command in your shell first
#     and paste the OUTPUT.
#   * NO `export` prefix. NO trailing comments on a value line - a `#` after a
#     value may be read as part of the value.
#   * Do not quote values unless the value genuinely contains a space. Quotes are
#     easy to get wrong here and a stray quote ends up inside the password.
#   * AVOID `$` and `#` characters inside passwords and keys entirely. Hex output
#     from openssl contains neither, which is why hex is recommended below.
#   * Blank lines and whole-line `#` comments are fine.
#
# 中文：
#   * 純粹的 KEY=VALUE，一行一組，不能有別的東西。
#   * 「不做」任何 shell 變數展開。`${VAR}`、`${VAR:-預設值}`、`${VAR:?訊息}`
#     在這裡完全無效——那些只是 docker-compose.yml 的功能。每個值都必須完整地、
#     照字面寫出來。
#   * 「不做」指令替換。`$(openssl rand -hex 32)` 不會被執行，只會被當成那串文字
#     原封不動存起來。請先在 shell 執行指令，再把「輸出結果」貼進來。
#   * 不要加 `export` 前綴。值的後面不要加行尾註解——值後面的 `#` 可能被當成值的一部分。
#   * 除非值裡真的含有空白，否則不要加引號。在這裡加引號很容易出錯，
#     多餘的引號會被當成密碼的一部分。
#   * 密碼與金鑰請完全避開 `$` 與 `#` 字元。openssl 的 hex 輸出兩者都不含，
#     這也是下方建議使用 hex 的原因。
#   * 空行與整行 `#` 註解是可以的。
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GENERATE VALUES FIRST, THEN PASTE / 先產生值，再貼上
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   echo "sk-$(openssl rand -hex 32)"     ->  LITELLM_MASTER_KEY
#   echo "sk-$(openssl rand -hex 32)"     ->  LITELLM_SALT_KEY
#   openssl rand -hex 24                  ->  POSTGRES_PASSWORD
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WHICH UNIT READS WHAT / 哪一個 unit 讀哪些變數
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# English:
#   litellm-postgres.container needs POSTGRES_USER, POSTGRES_PASSWORD,
#   POSTGRES_DB. litellm.container needs OPENROUTER_API_KEY,
#   LITELLM_MASTER_KEY, LITELLM_SALT_KEY, DATABASE_URL and the behaviour flags.
#   Sharing one file between both units is simplest and is what the shipped
#   units do. If you prefer least privilege, split it into two files
#   (postgres.env / litellm.env) - the variables do not overlap.
#   Note that PGDATA is NOT here: it is set with Environment= directly in the
#   postgres unit because it is a fixed path, not a secret.
#   Note also that the published port is NOT here: a Quadlet unit's
#   PublishPort= is static text in the unit file, so change it there (or with a
#   drop-in) rather than expecting a variable to be expanded.
# 中文：
#   litellm-postgres.container 需要 POSTGRES_USER、POSTGRES_PASSWORD、POSTGRES_DB。
#   litellm.container 需要 OPENROUTER_API_KEY、LITELLM_MASTER_KEY、
#   LITELLM_SALT_KEY、DATABASE_URL 以及各項行為旗標。
#   兩個 unit 共用同一個檔案最簡單，本套件提供的 unit 就是這樣做。
#   若你想採取最小權限原則，可以拆成兩個檔案（postgres.env / litellm.env）——
#   兩邊的變數並無重疊。
#   請注意 PGDATA 不在這裡：它是固定路徑而非機密，直接寫在 postgres unit 的
#   Environment= 裡。
#   published port 也不在這裡：Quadlet unit 的 PublishPort= 是 unit 檔中的靜態文字，
#   要改請直接改 unit（或用 drop-in），不要期待變數會被展開。
# =============================================================================


# --- OpenRouter ---------------------------------------------------------------
# English: All models route through OpenRouter. config/config.yaml reads this as
#          os.environ/OPENROUTER_API_KEY. Get one from openrouter.ai/keys.
# 中文：    所有模型都經由 OpenRouter 轉送。config/config.yaml 以
#          os.environ/OPENROUTER_API_KEY 讀取。請至 openrouter.ai/keys 申請。
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-REPLACE_ME


# --- LiteLLM admin credential -------------------------------------------------
# English: Authenticates admin API calls and IS the Admin UI password
#          (username `admin` at http://<host>:4000/ui). Must start with sk-.
# 中文：    用於管理 API 的驗證，同時也是 Admin UI 的登入密碼
#          （帳號 `admin`，網址 http://<主機>:4000/ui）。必須以 sk- 開頭。
LITELLM_MASTER_KEY=sk-REPLACE_ME


# =============================================================================
# LITELLM_SALT_KEY  -  SET ONCE, NEVER ROTATE / 只設定一次，永遠不要更換
# =============================================================================
# English:
#   Encrypts every provider credential LiteLLM stores in PostgreSQL. CHANGING IT
#   MAKES ALL OF THEM PERMANENTLY UNDECRYPTABLE, with no recovery path. LiteLLM
#   will not crash when this happens - decryption failures are non-blocking, so
#   models just stop working and the log quietly asks "Did your master_key/salt
#   key change recently?".
#   Set it explicitly BEFORE the first start: if it is unset, LiteLLM silently
#   uses LITELLM_MASTER_KEY as the encryption key, so adding a salt key later -
#   or rotating the master key while this is unset - breaks everything exactly
#   as a rotation would.
#   BACK THIS VALUE UP off-host, next to your database backups.
# 中文：
#   用來加密 LiteLLM 寫入 PostgreSQL 的所有供應商憑證。一旦更換，
#   這些憑證將「永久無法解密」，沒有任何救援手段。
#   而且 LiteLLM 不會因此崩潰——解密失敗屬於非阻斷式錯誤，模型只會安靜地失效，
#   log 裡僅出現一句「Did your master_key/salt key change recently?」。
#   請務必在「第一次啟動之前」就明確設定：若未設定，LiteLLM 會安靜地改用
#   LITELLM_MASTER_KEY 當作加密金鑰；因此日後才補上 salt key，
#   或在未設定的情況下更換 master key，效果都等同於更換金鑰而導致全毀。
#   請把這個值「備份」到本機以外的地方，與資料庫備份放在一起。
# =============================================================================
LITELLM_SALT_KEY=sk-REPLACE_ME


# --- PostgreSQL ---------------------------------------------------------------
# English: POSTGRES_USER / POSTGRES_DB are not secrets and match the k3s
#          deployment. POSTGRES_PASSWORD is a secret with no default - generate
#          it with `openssl rand -hex 24` and paste the output.
#          The healthcheck in litellm-postgres.container hardcodes
#          `pg_isready -U litellm -d litellm` on purpose (a `$` inside HealthCmd=
#          is subject to systemd expansion and would silently vanish). If you
#          change POSTGRES_USER or POSTGRES_DB, edit that unit's HealthCmd= too.
# 中文：    POSTGRES_USER 與 POSTGRES_DB 不是機密，且與 k3s 部署一致。
#          POSTGRES_PASSWORD 是機密且沒有預設值——請用 `openssl rand -hex 24`
#          產生後把輸出貼上。
#          litellm-postgres.container 的健康檢查刻意寫死
#          `pg_isready -U litellm -d litellm`（HealthCmd= 中的 `$` 會被 systemd
#          展開而導致變數安靜地消失）。若你更改了 POSTGRES_USER 或 POSTGRES_DB，
#          請一併修改該 unit 的 HealthCmd=。
POSTGRES_USER=litellm
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_TO_SECURE_PASSWORD
POSTGRES_DB=litellm


# --- Database connection string -----------------------------------------------
# English: Host part MUST be litellm-postgres - that is the ContainerName= of
#          the postgres unit (aardvark-dns resolves container names), and also
#          the headless Service name in k3s, so this exact string is portable
#          across all three deployments.
#          Do NOT use localhost: the containers are in separate network
#          namespaces and resolve each other through the user-defined bridge
#          network's DNS (aardvark-dns).
#          The user / password / database name here must match the three values
#          above; nothing derives them automatically.
#          If your password contains any of  : / ? # [ ] @  it must be
#          percent-encoded here. Hex output avoids the issue.
# 中文：    主機名稱「必須」是 litellm-postgres——那是 postgres unit 的
#          ContainerName=（aardvark-dns 會解析容器名稱），也是 k3s 中
#          headless Service 的名稱，因此同一組字串可在三種部署方式之間通用。
#          請勿使用 localhost：兩個容器位於不同的 network namespace，
#          是透過使用者自訂 bridge 網路的 DNS（aardvark-dns）互相解析。
#          此處的帳號 / 密碼 / 資料庫名稱必須與上面三個值一致，系統不會自動套用。
#          若密碼含有 : / ? # [ ] @ 等字元，在此必須做 percent-encoding；
#          使用 hex 輸出即可避開。
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://litellm:CHANGE_ME_TO_SECURE_PASSWORD@litellm-postgres:5432/litellm


# --- Behaviour flags (carried over from the k3s Deployment) --------------------
# ==> SET THESE IN quadlet/litellm.container, NOT HERE. <==
# English: In the Quadlet path these four flags - STORE_MODEL_IN_DB,
#          LITELLM_MODE, LITELLM_LOG and DISABLE_SCHEMA_UPDATE - are pinned as
#          Environment= lines in quadlet/litellm.container. Podman applies
#          --env-file first and then lets --env override it, so an assignment
#          here would be silently masked. They are therefore left commented out
#          below, for reference only. Edit the unit file and re-run
#          `systemctl --user daemon-reload && systemctl --user restart litellm.service`.
#          (The compose path is different: there they DO come from .env.)
# 中文：    在 Quadlet 路徑中，STORE_MODEL_IN_DB、LITELLM_MODE、LITELLM_LOG 與
#          DISABLE_SCHEMA_UPDATE 這四個旗標是寫死在 quadlet/litellm.container
#          的 Environment= 行。Podman 會先套用 --env-file，再讓 --env 覆蓋它，
#          因此在這裡賦值會被無聲地蓋掉。下方僅以註解形式保留作為參考。
#          請改編輯 unit 檔，然後執行
#          `systemctl --user daemon-reload && systemctl --user restart litellm.service`。
#          （compose 路徑則不同：那邊這四個確實來自 .env。）
# English: STORE_MODEL_IN_DB=True persists models added from the Admin UI into
#          PostgreSQL. LITELLM_MODE=PRODUCTION disables LiteLLM's load_dotenv().
#          LITELLM_LOG accepts DEBUG / INFO / ERROR; note the off-by-one naming -
#          INFO is the env equivalent of the CLI's --debug. INFO matches k3s.
# 中文：    STORE_MODEL_IN_DB=True 會把 Admin UI 新增的模型持久化到 PostgreSQL。
#          LITELLM_MODE=PRODUCTION 會停用 LiteLLM 的 load_dotenv()。
#          LITELLM_LOG 可設 DEBUG / INFO / ERROR；請注意名稱錯位——INFO 相當於
#          CLI 的 --debug。INFO 與 k3s 一致。
#STORE_MODEL_IN_DB=True      # set in quadlet/litellm.container
#LITELLM_MODE=PRODUCTION     # set in quadlet/litellm.container
#LITELLM_LOG=INFO            # set in quadlet/litellm.container


# =============================================================================
# DISABLE_SCHEMA_UPDATE  -  DO NOT COPY THE k3s VALUE / 不要照抄 k3s 的值
# =============================================================================
# English:
#   Keep this at false - but set it in quadlet/litellm.container, not here: the
#   unit file's Environment= line overrides anything this env file says.
#   The k3s manifests set it to "true" because their schema
#   already exists and multiple rolling proxy pods must not race on migrations -
#   and because a dedicated migrations Job owns them there.
#   This stack has no migrations Job and starts against a brand-new EMPTY volume.
#   With true, the proxy swaps `prisma migrate deploy` for a read-only
#   `prisma migrate diff` that prints the needed SQL and runs none of it: no
#   table is ever created, /health/readiness never reports the DB connected, and
#   the container stays unhealthy forever for a very non-obvious reason.
#   With false (LiteLLM's own default) the single proxy container creates the
#   schema on first boot and finds nothing to do afterwards. Exactly one process
#   here could ever migrate, so there is no race to prevent.
#   Truthy strings accepted by LiteLLM: true, 1, t, y, yes (case-insensitive).
# 中文：
#   請保持 false——但請在 quadlet/litellm.container 中設定，而不是這裡：
#   unit 檔的 Environment= 行會覆蓋本檔的任何設定。
#   k3s 的 manifest 設為 "true"，是因為那邊的 schema 早已存在、
#   多個滾動更新中的 proxy pod 不能互相搶著跑 migration，而且那邊有專責的
#   migration Job 負責這件事。
#   本堆疊沒有 migration Job，而且是對著一個「全新的空 volume」啟動。
#   設為 true 時，Proxy 會把 `prisma migrate deploy` 換成唯讀的
#   `prisma migrate diff`：只把需要的 SQL 印出來，一行都不執行；
#   結果是資料表永遠不會被建立、/health/readiness 永遠不會回報資料庫已連線，
#   容器會以極不明顯的原因永遠處於不健康狀態。
#   設為 false（LiteLLM 本身的預設值）時，唯一的 proxy 容器會在第一次啟動時建立
#   schema，之後每次啟動都沒事可做。這裡只有一個行程可能執行 migration，
#   因此不存在需要避免的競爭。
#   LiteLLM 接受的真值字串：true、1、t、y、yes（不分大小寫）。
# =============================================================================
#DISABLE_SCHEMA_UPDATE=false  # set in quadlet/litellm.container


# =============================================================================
# DELIBERATELY ABSENT: TUNNEL_TOKEN / cloudflared
# 刻意不提供：TUNNEL_TOKEN / cloudflared
# =============================================================================
# English: There is no cloudflared unit in quadlet/ and no tunnel token variable
#          here. NEVER paste the k3s deployment's Cloudflare tunnel token into
#          this file. A second connector using the same token becomes another
#          endpoint of that same tunnel and Cloudflare will load-balance live
#          production traffic across both. For external access use a reverse
#          proxy, a Tailscale/WireGuard overlay, or a firewalled port publish -
#          or create a NEW tunnel with a NEW hostname and a NEW token.
# 中文：    quadlet/ 目錄中沒有 cloudflared unit，這裡也沒有 tunnel token 變數。
#          絕對不要把 k3s 部署使用的 Cloudflare tunnel token 貼進本檔。
#          用同一組 token 的第二個 connector 會成為「同一條 tunnel」的另一個端點，
#          Cloudflare 會把正式流量在兩者之間負載平衡。
#          需要對外存取請改用反向代理、Tailscale/WireGuard 疊加網路，
#          或有防火牆保護的連接埠發布；也可以另外建立
#          「新的 tunnel、新的網域名稱、新的 token」。
# =============================================================================
